00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.030
<i>Her breasts aren't very great,
but her weapon is!</i>

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:14.270
Where'd you get that anyway?!

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:17.640
<i>The luggage Kaoru-chan had you carry.</i>

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:21.900
Geez, so he was prepared
from the very start!

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:24.650
It's pissed.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:27.800
<i>L-let's just leave for now!</i>

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:31.840
Alright! Gimme that!
I'll bring up the rear!

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:34.660
<i>You better protect us!</i>

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:36.020
That monster...

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:41.900
It's huge body oozes heat, but it
instantly vanished from my thermo!

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:44.160
Can it really do that?!

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:48.360
From behind?!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:54.440
<i>M-Master!</i>

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:56.410
<i>Help!</i>

00:18:58.680 --> 00:19:01.650
What the hell's going on?!

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:05.350
What's he doing here?! He was
behind us! How's that possible?!

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:08.320
What're they doing in that hole?!
Morons! Runt! Big-chest!

00:19:08.320 --> 00:19:10.560
I can hit him with a rocket
and end all this.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:13.730
But they'd pay the price!
My boob plan would go up in smoke!

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:17.200
Damn! They're too close to him!
Was that the bastard's plan?!

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:21.600
Why the hostages?! Does that mean
he doesn't have super strength?!

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:23.370
Alright, then!

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.510
But I can't let 'em die!

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:29.540
I really look forward to Taiko
becoming a hottie in the near future,

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:33.710
and Asagiri Junko is a hottie
I'd love for the present!

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:37.250
Both would be a big waste dead!

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:41.460
But I'd be lucky to save even one!

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:44.730
I can't save 'em both!
Which do I save?!

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:46.060
The bountiful future?!

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:47.830
Present pleasure?!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:52.860
Which do I choose? Which one?!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:59.010
Time to die, asshole!

00:19:59.010 --> 00:19:59.810
<i>Master!</i>

00:19:59.810 --> 00:20:03.500
<i>What're you doing?! Don't be stupid!</i>

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:06.270
<i>Hey!</i>

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:08.350
Follow me, Kosuna!

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:09.840
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:24.100
<i>He's not coming... Do you think he's dead?</i>

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:28.400
Idiot! Don't relax until
you've seen his corpse!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.370
Damn...

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:33.810
I was gonna blast him away
if he decided to drop by, but...

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:36.740
<i>Quit being reckless, will you?!</i>

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:40.980
<i>We could've been blown up or
flattened if you had screwed up!</i>

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:43.230
Who cares, you're safe now.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:48.320
So that freak came out of this hole...

00:20:48.320 --> 00:20:51.230
<i>Yeah! He totally scared me!</i>

00:20:51.230 --> 00:20:55.400
<i>I wish you could've seen her
face when the monster came out!</i>

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:59.260
<i>Like you could really
see me through my helmet!</i>

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:05.170
Now I see. So that's why you
won't chase us, you coward...

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:06.740
<i>Coward?</i>

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:10.240
He used these tunnels to sneak up on us.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.650
That's how he was able
to appear and disappear.

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:15.820
There must be tons of
tunnels beneath the city!

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:19.750
<i>I get it! So he's being cautious
now that we know his trick!</i>

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:24.190
OK! We'll use 'em to go back!
He can't do nothin' down here!

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:27.590
There's not much room,
and he'd be fully exposed!

00:21:29.530 --> 00:21:31.930
<i>Oh! You're alive!</i>

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:34.770
Yes, somehow or other...

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:39.610
<i>You're horrible, Kaoru-chan!
You should've said that thing was there!</i>

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.580
<i>Now, now...</i>

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:48.050
<i>Impressive, boy. You're the first
to ever return from scouting.</i>

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:52.790
I know that treasure hunters
aren't talkative, so I won't complain.

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:58.490
But surely you can tell us now.
What was that thing?!

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.300
<i>He's a guardian.</i>

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:09.300
<i>He's constantly protected that city,
whose denizens died centuries ago.</i>

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:15.810
<i>He punishes all who enter
the inner wall that surrounds it.</i>

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:19.480
<i>He is that city of death's...</i>

00:22:19.480 --> 00:22:22.380
<i>...guardian.</i>

00:23:55.550 --> 00:23:56.380
<i>Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu here!</i>

00:23:56.380 --> 00:24:00.050
<i>'Tis the season for warm food!
Warm stew is especially delicious!</i>

00:24:00.050 --> 00:24:02.960
<i>Next time is "Sunabo Hustles",
"Kosuna Does Errands",</i>

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:04.990
<i>and "'Junko' or 'Boobie Lady'?"</i>

00:24:04.990 --> 00:24:07.060
<i>Miss it and it's rock-paper...</i>

00:24:07.060 --> 00:24:10.240
<i>Wait! It's really
"Guardian and Treasure Hunter"!</i>
